Slide 6: System Methodology

• Bullet Points:
	• Data Acquisition & Training: High-fidelity weapon images and user profile photos are compiled and trained using YOLOv8 via Google Colab.
	• Face Profiling: Facial matrices are processed into a 128-Dimensional vector space, evaluating Euclidean distances to grant or deny system access.
	• Object Parsing: YOLOv8 extracts spatial segments to scan specifically for threat patterns (fire, handguns, heavy weapons).
	• Array Aggregation: Decision logic merges identity tags and object tags instantly to compute immediate situational threat status.

